# Local patch to the vendored ai-news-radar checkout.
#
# The checkout itself (groups/ai-news/ai-news-radar/) is git-ignored: it is a
# shallow clone of https://github.com/LearnPrompt/ai-news-radar.git whose
# data/*.json files churn on every scrape run. This patch preserves the only
# hand-made source change so it survives a re-clone.
#
# Base commit: f7d60157401c428043d01652627f7acbe3037939 ("chore: update ai news snapshot")
# Change:      drop the AI Breakfast source (dead r.jina.ai proxy fetch).
#
# Re-apply after a fresh clone with:
#   git -C groups/ai-news/ai-news-radar apply ../../../groups/ai-news/ai-news-radar.patch
#
